{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Zero Product Property.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Zero Product Property.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"zero product property zero product property","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Zero Product Property.md","fileName":"Zero Product Property.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Zero Product Property","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:41\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Quadratic Equations]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Quadratic Equations","Polynomial Factorization","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Zero Product Property.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Zero Product Property.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"zero product property zero product property","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Zero Product Property.md","fileName":"Zero Product Property.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Zero Product Property","heading":"Zero Product Property","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The zero product property states that if a product of real numbers equals zero, at least one factor equals zero:\n\n$$ab=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad a=0\\text{ or }b=0.$$\n\nFor several factors, each factor supplies a possible equation. This property connects [[Polynomial Factorization]] to equation solving. It applies only when the product equals zero; from (ab=c) with (c\\neq0), the factors cannot be set separately equal to (c) or zero.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Quadratic Equations","Polynomial Factorization","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Zero Product Property.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Zero Product Property.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"zero product property zero product property","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Zero Product Property.md","fileName":"Zero Product Property.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Zero Product Property","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[algebraessentials.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Quadratic Equations","Polynomial Factorization","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}